{"author":["Elastic"],"building_block_type":"default","description":"检测构建块：发现域组。对应需求：侦察发现。官方：Discovery of Domain Groups。","from":"now-119m","index":["logs-endpoint.events.*","endgame-*","auditbeat-*","logs-auditd_manager.auditd-*","logs-crowdstrike.fdr*"],"interval":"60m","language":"eql","license":"Elastic License v2","name":"【默认】构建块：发现域组","risk_score":21,"rule_id":"b92d5eae-70bb-4b66-be27-f98ba9d0ccdc","severity":"low","tags":["操作系统: Linux","主题: 侦察发现","来源: 默认","对应需求: 侦察发现"],"timestamp_override":"event.ingested","type":"eql","query":"process where host.os.type == \"linux\" and event.type == \"start\" and event.action in (\"exec\", \"exec_event\", \"executed\", \"process_started\", \"ProcessRollup2\")\n and (\n  process.name in (\"ldapsearch\", \"dscacheutil\") or (process.name == \"dscl\" and process.args : \"*-list*\")\n)\n","threat":[{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1069","name":"Permission Groups Discovery","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1069/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1069.002","name":"Domain Groups","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1069/002/"}]}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0007","name":"Discovery","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0007/"}}],"false_positives":["合法变更窗口内的运维、发布或安全扫描"],"related_integrations":[{"package":"endpoint","version":"*"},{"package":"auditd_manager","version":"*"},{"package":"crowdstrike","version":"*"}],"note":"## 调查指引\n\n### 规则说明\n构建块：发现域组\n\n### 为何重要\n摸清账号、网络、主机或云资源\n\n### 调查步骤\n1. 核对告警实体、进程/网络字段与时间窗。\n2. 核对是否符合变更窗口与已知业务工具。\n3. 关联同主机或同账号前后同类告警。\n\n### 常见误报\n- 合法变更窗口内的运维、发布或安全扫描\n\n### 响应建议\n1. 确认是否授权与变更窗口。\n2. 无授权则隔离相关主机或账号并排查落地与外连。\n3. 按主机与用户关联前后同类告警。\n","setup":"## 设置说明\n\n1. 按规则数据源接入对应日志（终端、云、身份或网络）。\n2. 构建块规则用于关联，确认数据流有数据后再评估。\n","investigation_fields":{"field_names":["@timestamp","host.name","user.name","cloud.account.id","process.name","process.command_line","file.path","source.ip","destination.ip","event.action","message"]},"version":7,"immutable":true,"rule_source":{"type":"external","is_customized":true,"customized_fields":[{"field_name":"name"},{"field_name":"description"},{"field_name":"note"},{"field_name":"setup"},{"field_name":"false_positives"},{"field_name":"tags"},{"field_name":"investigation_fields"}],"has_base_version":true},"actions":[],"exceptions_list":[],"risk_score_mapping":[],"severity_mapping":[],"required_fields":[],"output_index":"","revision":1,"enabled":true,"max_signals":100,"to":"now","references":[]}
